sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Handler
    participant TR as ITicketRepository
    participant AR as IAuditEventRepository
    participant OR as IOutboxRepository
    participant UoW as InMemoryUnitOfWork (Scoped)
    participant Store as InMemoryStore (Singleton)

    H->>TR: AddAsync(ticket)
    TR->>UoW: PendingAdds.Add(ticket)
    H->>AR: AddAsync(auditEvent)
    AR->>UoW: PendingAdds.Add(auditEvent)
    H->>OR: AddAsync(outboxMessage)
    OR->>UoW: PendingAdds.Add(outboxMessage)
    Note over UoW: all three buffered – none visible yet

    H->>UoW: SaveChangesAsync()
    UoW->>Store: ApplyAdds([ticket])
    UoW->>Store: AppendAuditEvents([auditEvent])
    UoW->>Store: AppendOutboxMessages([outboxMessage])
    Note over Store: atomic flush – all or nothing
    Store-->>UoW: ok
    UoW->>UoW: PendingAdds.Clear()
    UoW-->>H: completed